[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16080.63, "timestamp": "04:28:00", "text": "所以他大概认为是我允许的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16083.59, "timestamp": "04:28:03", "text": "东西。但我当时并不知道。我感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16085.429, "timestamp": "04:28:05", "text": "合作结束后，在我结束了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16088.95, "timestamp": "04:28:08", "text": "直播时，我感觉自己像个不属于我的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16090.95, "timestamp": "04:28:10", "text": "知道。通常情况下，当你进行直播时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16092.389, "timestamp": "04:28:12", "text": "这些东西，你应该感到快乐，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16094.229, "timestamp": "04:28:14", "text": "正确的？哦，这是我做的。我能够"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16096.63, "timestamp": "04:28:16", "text": "就说这么多吧。大家都很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16098.71, "timestamp": "04:28:18", "text": "正确的？但那天我感觉非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16103.59, "timestamp": "04:28:23", "text": "坏的。我当时就……开始哭了起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16109.03, "timestamp": "04:28:29", "text": "在我按下结束直播按钮后，运动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16112.149, "timestamp": "04:28:32", "text": "然后我回去告诉了某人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16114.79, "timestamp": "04:28:34", "text": "关于它。我想，呃，它曾经在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16118.07, "timestamp": "04:28:38", "text": "我们看到的服务器。我哭了。我加入了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16120.55, "timestamp": "04:28:40", "text": "他说：“是啊，我很难过。”我哭了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16123.67, "timestamp": "04:28:43", "text": "我当场就把事情经过告诉了他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16125.75, "timestamp": "04:28:45", "text": "他们查看了看板，发现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16129.59, "timestamp": "04:28:49", "text": "没错，那个人可不是开玩笑的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16132.71, "timestamp": "04:28:52", "text": "观众觉得那个人真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16136.149, "timestamp": "04:28:56", "text": "对你无礼，态度恶劣，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16139.03, "timestamp": "04:28:59", "text": "这种行为是不可接受的，"}]